# Binaries
/yggdrasil
/docs-gen
/dist/
*.exe
/tmp/

# Built frontend — produced by `npm run build`, embedded at build time via
# `//go:embed all:web/dist`. The whole dist is gitignored: its hashed asset
# filenames change on every build and caused a merge conflict on every parallel
# branch. Only .gitkeep is tracked, so the directory (and the embed pattern)
# survive a fresh clone and `go build` compiles even before a frontend build.
# CI and release build the real bundle. For a working UI locally, run
# `cd web && npm ci && npm run build` before `go build`.
/web/dist/
!/web/dist/.gitkeep
/web/node_modules/
/web/.svelte-kit/

# Local state
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
config.yaml
!deploy/config.yaml.example

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local dev launch config (machine-specific paths)
.claude/launch.json
.dev/
WISHLIST.md

# Session handover notes. Deliberately NOT tracked: HANDOFF.md was removed from
# this public repo in #245 because it carried internal access detail — box
# addresses, sudo arrangements, paths to SSH keys and API tokens. The file is
# useful locally and must never be committed again.
HANDOFF.md
